           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Dear&nbsp;{{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_First_Name__c}}}&nbsp;{{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_Last_Name__c}}},<br /><br /> Thank you for starting your journey with Zeta Charter Schools!&nbsp;<br /><br /><strong>Please take a few minutes to </strong></span></span><strong><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/login?ec=302&amp;startURL=%2Fs%2F"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">complete your application today</span></span></a></strong><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>.</strong> Once you do, your family will be invited to join upcoming events to learn more about Zeta’s next-generation education.&nbsp;<br /><br /> Zeta is a public charter school network that provides a tuition-free, pre-K through high school journey in the Bronx, Manhattan, and Queens. Our whole-child approach combines rigorous academics, expert-led Specialty classes, and a joyful community where students are known and loved. At Zeta, students discover their strengths and passions as they prepare for college and beyond.<br /><br /> If you have any questions as you </span></span><a href="https://"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">complete your application</span></span></a><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">, please reach out to us at </span></span><a href="mailto: enroll@zetaschools.org"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">enroll@zetaschools.org</span></span></a><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> or call us at (646) 480-1654.&nbsp;<br /><br /> We look forward to getting to know your family!<br /><br /> Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools<br /><span style="color:#dddddd;">___________________________</span></span></span><br /> &nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Estimado/a </font>{{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_First_Name__c}}}&nbsp;{{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_Last_Name__c}}}:<br /><br /><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Le agradecemos que haya iniciado su recorrido con Zeta Charter Schools!<br /><br /><strong>Por favor, tómese unos minutos para </strong></font><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/login?ec=302&amp;startURL=%2Fs%2F"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>completar su solicitud hoy</strong></font></a><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>.</strong> Una vez que lo haga, su familia será invitada a unirse a los próximos eventos para obtener más información sobre la educación de próxima generación de Zeta.<br /><br /> Zeta es una red de escuelas públicas chárter que ofrece un recorrido educativo gratuito desde el prekínder hasta la escuela secundaria en el Bronx, Manhattan y Queens. Nuestro enfoque integral combina un riguroso nivel académico, clases especializadas dirigidas por expertos y una comunidad alegre donde los estudiantes son conocidos y queridos. En Zeta, los estudiantes descubren sus fortalezas y pasiones mientras se preparan para la universidad y más allá.<br /><br /> Si tiene alguna pregunta mientras </font><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/login?ec=302&amp;startURL=%2Fs%2F"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">completa su solicitud</font></a><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">, comuníquese con nosotros a </font><a href="mailto: enroll@zetaschools.org"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">enroll@zetaschools.org</font></a><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> o llámenos al (646) 480-1654.<br /><br /> ¡Esperamos llegar a conocer a su familia!<br /><br /> Atentamente,<br /><strong>El equipo de admisiones de Zeta</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools</font><br /><span style="color:#dddddd;">___________________________</span><br /> &nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">尊敬的 {{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_First_Name__c}}} {{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_Last_Name__c}}},<br /><br /> 感谢您开始 在 Zeta 特许学校的求学之旅！<br /><br /><strong>请花几分钟时间在今天&nbsp;</strong></font><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/login?ec=302&amp;startURL=%2Fs%2F"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>完成您的申请</strong></font></a><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>。</strong>完成申请后，您的家庭将受邀参加即将举行的活动，以深入了解 Zeta 的新世代教育。<br /><br /> Zeta 是一个公立特许学校教育网络，在布朗克斯、曼哈顿和皇后区提供从学前班到高中的免费教育。我们秉持全人教育理念，将扎实的学术课程、由专业教师授课的特色课程，以及充满欢乐与关爱的校园氛围融为一体，让每位学生都被了解、被关爱。在 Zeta，学生能够发现自己的优势与热爱，为升入大学及未来的发展做好准备。<br /><br /> 如果您在 </font><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/login?ec=302&amp;startURL=%2Fs%2F"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">完成 您的 申请</font></a><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">过程中有任何疑问，请通过 </font><a href="mailto: enroll@zetaschools.org"><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">enroll@zetaschools.org</font></a><font face="Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 与我们联系，或致电 (646) 480-1654。<br /><br /> 期待认识您和您的家人！<br /><br /> 此致，<br /><strong>Zeta 招生团队</strong><br /> Zeta 特许学校</font></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
